    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_10d257b4",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: fashion_forward; hasOverallIntent: positive; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a woman wearing a hijab, sunglasses, a Nike sweatshirt, leather jacket, and studded gloves, leaning against a railing in an urban setting. The text overlay \"fashion forward!\" is used to celebrate her style and confidence. There is no toxicity present in the image. The intent is to showcase modern, stylish fashion that embraces cultural identity (hijab) and personal expression. The meme does not target any specific group with harmful stereotypes or discriminatory language. It is a positive affirmation of individual style and empowerment, aligning with the visual presentation of the subject as fashionable and self-assured.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5a0614eb"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_225d4c83",
